  "Press <symbol=button_batsu> to evade or <symbol=button_l1> to parry enemy attacks. If you are armed, <symbol=button_l1> allows you to use your weapon to guard.": "",
  "While evading with <symbol=button_batsu>, press <symbol=button_batsu> or <symbol=button_l_stick>+<symbol=button_batsu> to roll away from danger.": "",
  "While evading with <symbol=button_batsu>, press <symbol=button_maru> to grab the enemy as you dodge.": "",
  "As you dodge with <symbol=button_batsu>, use <symbol=button_sankaku> to attack during evasive moves.": "",
  "While evading with <symbol=button_batsu>, use <symbol=button_sankaku> to unleash attacks during evasive moves.": "",
  "While using <symbol=button_batsu> to evade, press <symbol=button_shikaku> to deliver slashing attacks from a dodge.": "",
  "As you evade with <symbol=button_batsu>, use <symbol=button_shikaku> to shoot or tackle your enemy from a dodge.": "",
  "While guarding with <symbol=button_l1>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to deflect the enemy's attack and gain a chance to counter.": "",
  "While guarding with <symbol=button_l1>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to reflect the enemy's attack and gain the chance to strike back.": "",
  "You can use <symbol=button_left><symbol=button_up><symbol=button_right> and <symbol=button_down> to switch between styles. \nNow, press <symbol=button_up> and switch to the Wild Dancer.": "",
  "<symbol=button_maru> Phoenix Frenzy\n Press <symbol=button_maru> <symbol=button_maru> <symbol=button_maru> to chain up to three special attacks.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_maru> to grab, then <symbol=button_maru> to throw or <symbol=button_shikaku> to attack. Grabbing is often effective against guarding enemies.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_maru> to grab an enemy, then move to a wall and press <symbol=button_sankaku> once the Heat icon is displayed in the top right to perform a Heat Action.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Poison Rounds. Poison Rounds can inflict poison damage on the enemy.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Acid Rounds. Acid Rounds can dissolve the enemy's armor.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Flash Rounds. Flash Rounds can blind and incapacitate the enemy.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Thunder Rounds. Thunder Rounds can paralyze and incapacitate the enemy.": "",
  "Hold <symbol=button_r1> to take a fighting stance, then press <symbol=button_maru> just before an enemy attack connects to disarm them.": "",
  "While in the <symbol=button_r1> stance, press <symbol=button_sankaku> just before an enemy attack connects to deliver a powerful counterattack.": "",
  "Hold <symbol=button_r1> and press <symbol=button_shikaku> to adopt a shooting stance. This allows you to fire while in motion.": "",
  "After landing an attack with <symbol=button_r2>, press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly for consecutive attacks until the Heat Gauge is depleted.": "",
  "Press and hold <symbol=button_r2> to alternate between gun and sword attacks. This will expend the Heat Gauge while active.": "",
  "Press and hold <symbol=button_r2>, then release to mark surrounding foes.": "",
  "Hold, then release <symbol=button_r2>. The moment this attack lands, use <symbol=button_l_stick>+<symbol=button_shikaku> to strike another target. Each attack expends the Heat Gauge.": "",
  "In Wild Dancer, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to attack with your firearm.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_sankaku> to fire your equipped special ammo.": "",
  "While shooting with <symbol=button_shikaku>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to fire a hail of bullets horizontally.": "",
  "In Wild Dancer, press <symbol=button_shikaku> to attack with your sword.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly to perform a Rush Combo.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly for consecutive shots. Repeatedly shooting an enemy makes them drop their weapon.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly to perform consecutive attacks.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> to fire. Shots become less accurate at too far of a range.": "",
  "After <symbol=button_shikaku>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> for a Finishing Blow.": "",
  "After pressing <symbol=button_shikaku>, perform a Finishing Blow with <symbol=button_sankaku>.": "",
  "After <symbol=button_shikaku>, press and hold <symbol=button_sankaku> to charge up and increase the power of your Finishing Blow.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_up> to switch to the Wild Dancer.": "",
  "Swordsman is a style which employs charged attacks and a variety of defenses and counters.\n\nSummer Rainfall: an exclusive skill of the Swordsman. Press <symbol=button_maru> to break the enemy's guard.\n\nWhen fighting against other sword users, it is imperative to chip away at their defense while using <symbol=button_l1> to keep your own guard up.": "",
  "Wild Dancer is a style that employs continuous waves of sword and gun attacks.\n\nRemnant Silhouette: an exclusive skill of the Wild Dancer. Press <symbol=button_batsu> to halt your attack. Try following <symbol=button_batsu> with <symbol=button_shikaku>, <symbol=button_sankaku>, or <symbol=button_maru> to change up your offense and confuse the enemy.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_batsu> just before hitting the ground to break your fall.": "",
  "Make effective use of parries. Press <symbol=button_l1> just before an enemy attack connects to parry, even while on the offensive.": "",
  "Try shooting Enhanced Rounds. Enhanced Rounds are bullets that have no special effects but are extremely powerful.": "",
  "Tilt <symbol=button_l_stick> back and press <symbol=button_shikaku> to quickly shoot an enemy behind you.": "",
  "While attacking, press <symbol=button_batsu> to cancel your movement.\nDuring a <symbol=button_shikaku> combo, press <symbol=button_batsu> then <symbol=button_shikaku> again to unleash a flurry of attacks.": "",
  "Press <symbol=button_l1> just before an enemy attack connects to parry it.": "",
  "Now please, defeat your enemies.": "",
  "Brawler is a fighting style that employs martial arts, parries, and objects in the environment.\n\nWar Cry Counter: an exclusive skill of the Brawler. After parrying with <symbol=button_l1>, you'll become invincible for a length of time. Parry enemy attacks with <symbol=button_l1> to create opportunities to counterattack.\n\nRemember, though, that while barehanded you have no defense against blades.": "",
  "The orange gauge in the top left represents Ryoma's health. Be aware that if it reaches zero, the game is over.": "",
  "The blue gauge in the top left is the Heat Gauge, which is used to activate special Heat Actions. The Heat Gauge fills as you attack and depletes when you take damage.": "",
  "Gunman is a style that allows you to deliver unilateral attacks through long-distance shooting.\n\nRoaring Fusillade: an exclusive skill of the Gunman. During a <symbol=button_shikaku> combo, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to fire in a wide arc.\n\nThe Gunman style becomes less effective as enemies approach. Try to maintain your distance.": "",
